Subject: Integrating R-INLA code in a CRAN package (for outbreak detection)
Message-ID: <akPZnEroCCg.fjlOlGriqfAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/akPZnEroCCg/m/fjlOlGriqfAJ>
